1
00:00:00,180 --> 00:00:03,530
那个早晨与往常无异 非常宁静
It was an uneventful morning -- quiet.

2
00:00:04,030 --> 00:00:05,360
把每一集《单身汉》都保存下来
instead of saving every episode of "The bachelor,"

3
00:00:05,360 --> 00:00:06,010
你干嘛不直接拿
Why don't you just hit yourself

4
00:00:06,010 --> 00:00:07,560
大锤子砸你的头
on the head with a sledgehammer?!

5
00:00:07,560 --> 00:00:09,620
爸爸 音乐声调小点
Dad, turn down that song!

6
00:00:09,620 --> 00:00:11,250
*办不到*
* No can do *

7
00:00:11,250 --> 00:00:12,520
孩子们周五放假
The kids had a Friday off of school,

8
00:00:12,520 --> 00:00:13,490
所以我们接上曼尼
so we picked up Manny

9
00:00:13,490 --> 00:00:15,620
去我们最爱的薄饼店
and went to our favorite pancake place --

10
00:00:15,620 --> 00:00:16,580
放松一下嘛
Relaxing.

11
00:00:16,580 --> 00:00:17,910
米奇尔 你好
Mitchell, hi.

12
00:00:17,910 --> 00:00:18,860
什么
What?!

13
00:00:18,860 --> 00:00:20,140
让他跟小卡说
Oh, have him tell Cam

14
00:00:20,140 --> 00:00:21,430
我一小时后去接他打壁球
I'll pick him up for racquetball in an hour.

15
00:00:21,430 --> 00:00:22,760
这么吵我根本听不见他说什么
I can't even hear him it's so loud.

16
00:00:22,760 --> 00:00:25,630
-大家都闭嘴好吗 -真讨厌
- Can everybody just shut up?! - I hate it.

17
00:00:26,050 --> 00:00:27,800
很抱歉 总之
Sorry about that. Anyway...

18
00:00:27,800 --> 00:00:28,420
你好
Hello.

19
00:00:28,420 --> 00:00:30,750
你好 请问是菲尔·邓垃圾桶吗
Hello. Is this Phil Dumpster?

20
00:00:31,040 --> 00:00:32,090
干嘛 格尔
What do you want, Gil?

21
00:00:32,090 --> 00:00:33,950
没搞错吧 等等
Got to be kidding me. Hang on.

22
00:00:34,790 --> 00:00:37,640
我需要你代表我们两人
I need you to send a gift to mom

23
00:00:37,640 --> 00:00:39,000
送一份生日礼物给妈妈
for her birthday from the both of us.

24
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:40,170
不行 去年就是我送的
No, I did it last year.

25
00:00:40,170 --> 00:00:42,180
我知道 但我要你再送一次
I know, and I need you to do it again.

26
00:00:42,180 --> 00:00:44,250
听我说 1点20分我有个电话会议
Look, I've got a conference call at 1:20.

27
00:00:44,250 --> 00:00:45,750
之后卢克的家教要来家里
Then Luke's tutor comes to the house,

28
00:00:45,750 --> 00:00:46,780
45分有个销售会议
45 sales meeting,

29
00:00:46,780 --> 00:00:48,480
我还得送艾丽克斯去上柔道课
and I still got to get Alex to judo.

30
00:00:48,480 --> 00:00:50,940
但你还是挤出时间来找我无理取闹了
And yet you somehow found time to bitch at me.

31
00:00:51,340 --> 00:00:52,841
你还真是事业生活两不误啊
You really can have it all.

32
00:00:52,841 --> 00:00:55,421
说真的 随便给她买张礼品卡就行了
Honestly, just get her a stupid gift card,

33
00:00:55,421 --> 00:00:56,202
你个大号婴儿
you big baby!

34
00:00:57,681 --> 00:01:01,131
为什么事情一碰到他就都这么麻烦
Why does everything with him have be so dramatic?

35
00:01:07,971 --> 00:01:09,162
我们为什么要停下来
Why are we stopping?

36
00:01:24,341 --> 00:01:25,961
太好了
Hey. Oh. Perfect.

37
00:01:25,961 --> 00:01:27,891
你先是在电话里斥责我
Okay, first you berate me on the phone,

38
00:01:27,891 --> 00:01:29,751
现在又亲自来我办公室斥责我
Then you show up to my office and berate me in per--

39
00:01:29,751 --> 00:01:31,341
这是什么情况 我不喜欢这样
Oh, w-what is this? I don't care for this.

40
00:01:31,341 --> 00:01:32,331
我们出车祸了
We got in an accident.

41
00:01:32,331 --> 00:01:33,391
天呐
Oh, my God!

42
00:01:33,391 --> 00:01:35,171
我们差点出车祸了
We almost got in an accident.

43
00:01:35,171 --> 00:01:37,111
这差很多好吗
That seems like a really important distinction.

44
00:01:37,111 --> 00:01:38,381
一辆大卡车
There was this big truck,

45
00:01:38,381 --> 00:01:39,851
闯过停车标志
and it barreled through a stop sign,

46
00:01:39,851 --> 00:01:41,401
差几英寸我们就撞上了
And it missed our car by inches.

47
00:01:41,401 --> 00:01:43,541
天呐 大家都没事吧
Oh, my God! And everyone's okay?

48
00:01:43,541 --> 00:01:45,391
没事 只是都吓坏了
Yes, just very shaken up.

49
00:01:45,391 --> 00:01:47,951
但是 米奇尔 我真的很抱歉
But, Mitchell, I am so sorry

50
00:01:47,951 --> 00:01:49,311
刚才朝你大喊大叫
that I yelled at you before.

51
00:01:49,311 --> 00:01:51,611
我把送给老妈的生日贺卡带来了
Look, I brought you the birthday card for mom,

52
00:01:51,611 --> 00:01:54,001
-你也签个名 -好 谢谢
- And you can sign it. - Okay. Thank you.

53
00:01:54,001 --> 00:01:55,271
给我们最好的朋友
"To our best friend."

54
00:01:55,271 --> 00:01:57,001
有点讽刺啊 这是她的生日啊
That's a little sarcastic. It's her birthday.

55
00:01:57,001 --> 00:01:57,991
不 我是真心的
No, I mean it.

56
00:01:57,991 --> 00:02:00,231
米奇尔 我差点就死了
Mitchell, I almost died.

57
00:02:00,231 --> 00:02:02,221
我希望给我们的老妈过个很棒的生日
I want our mom to have a great birthday.

58
00:02:02,221 --> 00:02:03,341
又来了
Oh, and we're doing this again.

59
00:02:03,341 --> 00:02:03,991
-好吧 天呐 -是啊
- Okay. Oh, god. - Yeah.

60
00:02:03,991 --> 00:02:05,841
你好 我一会儿就过去
Hi. I'll be there in a sec, yeah.

61
00:02:06,951 --> 00:02:08,561
我的取证会被提前了
Okay, my deposition got moved up.

62
00:02:08,561 --> 00:02:09,221
太好了
That's great.

63
00:02:09,221 --> 00:02:10,871
我得把所有事情都改期
So I'll just have to move everything -- you know what?

64
00:02:10,871 --> 00:02:12,401
-我得在车上吃饭 然后 -不不不
- I'm gonna eat in the car and then- - No, no, no, no, no.

65
00:02:12,401 --> 00:02:13,301
不不不 给我 给我
No, no, no. Give it, give it!

66
00:02:13,301 --> 00:02:16,131
你知道我差点死掉之前在做什么吗
Do you know what I was doing right before I almost died?

67
00:02:16,131 --> 00:02:17,341
跟你现在做的一样
Exactly what you're doing.

68
00:02:17,341 --> 00:02:18,271
纵容自己的亲人瞎胡闹吗
Humoring a relative?

69
00:02:18,271 --> 00:02:21,181
不是 我在安排我人生中的每一分钟
No, no, scheduling my life down to the last minute.

70
00:02:21,181 --> 00:02:22,041
你看看这个
I mean, look at this --

71
00:02:22,041 --> 00:02:24,021
下午4点17分打电话给纽约办公室
"Call New York office -- 4:17 p.m."

72
00:02:24,021 --> 00:02:25,161
你有没有发现除了我们两个
Do you realize that everybody

73
00:02:25,161 --> 00:02:28,261
大家都以5分钟为计算时间的最小单位
but us rounds up to the nearest five minutes?

74
00:02:28,261 --> 00:02:29,681
米奇尔 今天的事情让我意识到
Today made me realize something, Mitchell.

75
00:02:29,681 --> 00:02:30,971
我不想当那种
No, I don't want to

76
00:02:30,971 --> 00:02:33,761
按分钟规划时间的人 你呢
be a 4:17 kind of person. Do you?

77
00:02:33,761 --> 00:02:33,981
我想
Yes, I do.

78
00:02:33,981 --> 00:02:36,021
因为那通电话必须在4点23分前打完
'cause that phone call needs to be done by 4:23

79
00:02:36,021 --> 00:02:38,571
否则到4点41分我就死定了
so that I am not a dead man by 4:41.

80
00:02:38,571 --> 00:02:39,491
把手机还我
Give me my phone.

81
00:02:39,491 --> 00:02:40,871
不不不 快给我 克莱尔
Nope. Nope. No. Give me -- Claire.

82
00:02:40,871 --> 00:02:42,091
我们要一起去做点什么
We're gonna do something together.

83
00:02:42,091 --> 00:02:43,721
来吧 今天请假吧
Yes, take the rest of the day off.

84
00:02:43,721 --> 00:02:44,581
办不到
I can't do that.

85
00:02:44,581 --> 00:02:46,232
你可以的 我就请假了
Yes, you can. I did!

86
00:02:46,232 --> 00:02:47,542
是啊 因为你是给你老爸打工
Yeah, 'cause you work for your father.

87
00:02:47,542 --> 00:02:49,222
不不不 我们必须这么做 米奇尔
No, no, no, we need this, Mitchell.

88
00:02:49,222 --> 00:02:49,702
真的必须这样
We really need this.

89
00:02:49,702 --> 00:02:51,382
克莱尔 我今天真的很忙
Claire, I'm really swamped today, and I --

90
00:02:51,382 --> 00:02:54,112
拜托拜托拜托拜托
Pleeeeeeeeeeeeeeeease...

91
00:02:54,112 --> 00:02:54,702
好了 快走吧
Stop. Just go.

92
00:02:54,702 --> 00:02:57,272
拜托拜托我们能滑慢点吗
Pleeeeease can we slow down?

93
00:02:57,272 --> 00:02:58,222
你快把我的手腕磨破了
You're chafing my wrist.

94
00:02:58,222 --> 00:02:59,532
别再装你不喜欢这样了
Don't pretend you're not loving this.

95
00:02:59,532 --> 00:03:01,712
好吧 我刚刚滑过一泡尿
Okay. All right. I think I just skated through some pee.

96
00:03:01,712 --> 00:03:02,742
现在我们能回去了吗
C-can we go back now?

97
00:03:02,742 --> 00:03:03,512
不行
No!

98
00:03:03,512 --> 00:03:05,802
不 因为我们不是预约狂魔
No, because we are not appointment-making control freaks.

99
00:03:05,802 --> 00:03:07,122
我们在找乐子呢
We are having fun.

100
00:03:07,122 --> 00:03:09,242
你是在找乐子 我是被你逼的
You are. I'm just doing what you're making me do.

101
00:03:09,252 --> 00:03:10,102
好吧 停下
Okay, okay, stop.

102
00:03:10,102 --> 00:03:11,182
不不不不不
No, no, no. No, no, no.

103
00:03:11,182 --> 00:03:11,922
我们回去吧 回去吧 回去吧
Let's go back, let's go back, let's go back.

104
00:03:11,922 --> 00:03:13,912
为什么 为什么非要现在回去
Why? Why do we have to go back now?

105
00:03:13,952 --> 00:03:15,302
为什么 我明白了 明白了
Why -- oh, I get it. I get it.

106
00:03:15,302 --> 00:03:17,482
你还在怕从地下通道里滑过去是吧
You're still scared to skate through the underpass.

107
00:03:17,482 --> 00:03:18,162
什么叫"还在"
What do you mean, "Still"?

108
00:03:18,162 --> 00:03:18,962
什么叫"害怕" 什么地下通道
What do you mean, "scared"? What underpass?

109
00:03:18,962 --> 00:03:20,232
米奇尔 你11岁时
Mitchell, you were 11 years old,

110
00:03:20,232 --> 00:03:21,552
妈妈让我带你一起
and mom made me take you with me

111
00:03:21,552 --> 00:03:23,102
和我朋友索菲·金去玩轮滑
when I was skating with my friend Sophie King,

112
00:03:23,102 --> 00:03:24,892
地下通道很黑 所以你害怕
and you were terrified to go through the underpass

113
00:03:24,892 --> 00:03:25,592
不敢过去
'cause it was dark,

114
00:03:25,592 --> 00:03:27,022
你还说里面肯定都是怪物
and you were sure it was filled with monsters,

115
00:03:27,022 --> 00:03:28,082
所以我们把你甩掉了
so we ditched you.

116
00:03:28,082 --> 00:03:29,202
我根本都不记得了
I don't remember this at all.

117
00:03:29,202 --> 00:03:31,282
我边滑走边叫你"大号婴儿"
Yeah, I skated away and called you a big baby.

118
00:03:31,282 --> 00:03:32,782
索菲朝我扔了块石头
Sophie threw a rock at me

119
00:03:32,782 --> 00:03:33,803
你还吼我"你真像个基佬"
and you yelled, "You're so gay."

120
00:03:34,162 --> 00:03:35,572
我是喊了
I did do that.

121
00:03:35,572 --> 00:03:37,542
是不是
Oh, didn't I?

122
00:03:37,852 --> 00:03:39,712
我们原来老用那个词儿
We used to use that word a lot.

123
00:03:39,762 --> 00:03:41,562
说谁都能用"基佬"
You used to be able to call anything gay.

124
00:03:42,412 --> 00:03:43,042
你怀念吗
Do you ever miss that?

125
00:03:43,042 --> 00:03:43,672
不
No.

126
00:03:43,672 --> 00:03:44,343
不
No.

127
00:03:44,712 --> 00:03:46,382
那很伤人
That's hurtful.

128
00:03:46,882 --> 00:03:47,803
是啊
Yeah.

129
00:03:48,442 --> 00:03:49,632
对不起 米奇尔
I'm sorry, Mitchell.

130
00:03:49,632 --> 00:03:50,202
你当时那么害怕
You were scared,

131
00:03:50,202 --> 00:03:51,762
我应该拉紧你的手走过通道的
and I should've held your hand through the tunnel,

132
00:03:51,762 --> 00:03:54,902
我不是...一个好姐姐
and I was -- I was not a good big sister.

133
00:03:54,932 --> 00:03:57,072
对不起 你能原谅我吗
I'm so sorry. Will you forgive me?

134
00:03:57,202 --> 00:03:58,612
-原谅 -原谅了吗
- Yes, yes. - You do?

135
00:03:58,612 --> 00:03:59,702
-原谅 我原谅你了 -我爱你
- Yes! I forgive you. - I love you.

136
00:03:59,702 --> 00:04:00,702
-我也爱你 -爱你哦
- Love you, too. - Love you!

137
00:04:00,702 --> 00:04:01,452
好了
Okay, okay. Okay.

138
00:04:01,452 --> 00:04:02,762
-我们滑起来 -对 我们滑
- Let's do this. - Yes, let's do this.

139
00:04:02,762 --> 00:04:03,742
-过来 -什么 干什么
- Come on. - What? What's happening?

140
00:04:03,742 --> 00:04:05,112
不是 我们要滑过通道
No, no, no, we're going -- we're going through the tunnel.

141
00:04:05,112 --> 00:04:05,862
不 老天爷啊 不要
No. God, no. No, no, no.

142
00:04:05,862 --> 00:04:07,032
不行 你得克服自己
Oh, no, you got to get over this.

143
00:04:07,032 --> 00:04:08,652
-不 好吧 -好啦 你放松
- No! All right. - Okay. Just let yourself go.

144
00:04:08,652 --> 00:04:10,782
-就随它吧 -好 我可以的
- Just let it go. Just -- you know? - Yep. I'm good.

145
00:04:10,782 --> 00:04:11,952
对 你得穿过去
Uh, yeah, you got to get past it.

146
00:04:11,952 --> 00:04:14,292
不 不 不 不要 克莱尔
N-n-no. No, no! No! N-n-no! Claire, no!

147
00:04:14,292 --> 00:04:15,262
不要啊
N-n-no! N-no!

148
00:04:15,262 --> 00:04:16,972
被分开那瞬间我挺抱歉的
I felt bad when we got separated,

149
00:04:16,972 --> 00:04:18,902
但我知道
but I knew that when he skated out

150
00:04:18,902 --> 00:04:20,002
等他在通道另一端出来的时候
the other side of that tunnel,

151
00:04:20,002 --> 00:04:22,772
一个心理伤疤会痊愈的
an emotional scar would've been healed.

152
00:04:22,772 --> 00:04:25,042
米奇尔 米奇尔
Mitchell?! Mitchell?

153
00:04:25,042 --> 00:04:26,852
不 不要啊 不要
No! N-no! N-n-no! N-no!

154
00:04:26,852 --> 00:04:28,672
天啊 怎么了 怎么了
Oh, my god! What happened? What happened?

155
00:04:28,672 --> 00:04:29,432
-太恐怖了 -然后呢
- It w-- it was terrible! -Yes.

156
00:04:29,432 --> 00:04:31,312
他们把我的钱包 轮滑鞋和领带都抢了
They took my wallet and my skates and my tie.

157
00:04:31,312 --> 00:04:32,662
一个流浪汉要领带干嘛使
What -- what homeless person needs a tie?

158
00:04:32,662 --> 00:04:34,462
天啊 太对不起了 米奇尔
Oh, my god. I am so sorry, Mitchell!

159
00:04:34,462 --> 00:04:35,442
好了 能把我手机还给我吗
Okay, um... Can you give me my phone?

160
00:04:35,442 --> 00:04:37,052
我得注销银行卡
'cause I got to, you know, cancel my cards.

161
00:04:37,052 --> 00:04:38,003
好 给 给你 希望还有电
Yeah, yeah, yeah. Oh, god. I hope you have juice.

162
00:04:38,003 --> 00:04:39,523
这一天震死我了
That thing has been buzzing like crazy.

163
00:04:39,523 --> 00:04:40,813
天呐 好吧
Oh, god! Okay. Okay.

164
00:04:40,813 --> 00:04:41,443
我的会议被提前了
My meeting's been pushed up.

165
00:04:41,443 --> 00:04:42,373
15分钟后就要开始了
It's in 15 minutes.

166
00:04:42,373 --> 00:04:44,153
好吧 好吧
Okay, okay. Okay, okay.

167
00:04:44,153 --> 00:04:45,354
看着我 看着我
Look at me. Look at me.

168
00:04:45,993 --> 00:04:47,673
这是个测试 我们不为小事忧心
This is a test, and we don't sweat the small stuff.

169
00:04:47,673 --> 00:04:49,303
-就随它吧 -够了 停
- Just let it go. - Stop it! Stop it.

170
00:04:49,303 --> 00:04:50,883
我知道你觉得找到了新自我
I know you think you discovered the new you,

171
00:04:50,883 --> 00:04:51,933
但你在努力不去控制别人的时候
but you are controlling

172
00:04:51,933 --> 00:04:53,563
仍然是个彻头彻尾的控制狂
even when you're trying to not be controlling.

173
00:04:53,563 --> 00:04:55,503
所以 把轮滑鞋给我
So j-- give me your skates.

174
00:04:55,533 --> 00:04:56,233
什么 为什么
What? Why?

175
00:04:56,233 --> 00:04:57,153
我被你拖了这么远
You've dragged me so far,

176
00:04:57,153 --> 00:04:59,263
现在我离办公室比离我们的车要近
we're closer to my office than we are to the car.

177
00:04:59,263 --> 00:05:00,434
脱鞋
Take 'em off!

178
00:05:01,053 --> 00:05:02,673
他还是没准备好
He just wasn't ready.

179
00:05:02,673 --> 00:05:03,353
但我呢
But me?

180
00:05:03,353 --> 00:05:05,063
我要让那些曾经掌控我生活的
I had a message for the small stuff

181
00:05:05,063 --> 00:05:06,623
小事情知道我的讯息
that used to rule my life.

182
00:05:06,623 --> 00:05:08,993
菲尔 亲爱的 你怎么样
Hey, Phil. Honey, how you holding up?

183
00:05:08,993 --> 00:05:09,854
很好
Good.

184
00:05:09,963 --> 00:05:13,413
我在沙滩这 长话短说
So, I'm at the beach -- long story.

185
00:05:13,473 --> 00:05:15,573
你介不介意在家等着
Anyway, I was hoping you wouldn't mind

186
00:05:15,573 --> 00:05:16,923
卢克的家教来
waiting at the house for Luke's tutor.

187
00:05:16,923 --> 00:05:18,393
我介意 很介意
Actually, I would mind. I'd mind quite a bit.

188
00:05:18,393 --> 00:05:19,504
我这很忙
I'm kind of busy.

189
00:05:19,943 --> 00:05:21,183
好的 很好
Okay, great.

190
00:05:21,183 --> 00:05:22,753
去死吧 鸡毛蒜皮的小事
Suck it, small stuff.

191
00:05:27,783 --> 00:05:28,914
我们为什么停下
Why are we stopping?

192
00:05:29,323 --> 00:05:33,003
对许多人来说 濒死体验是一种警钟
For many, a near-miss with death is a wake-up call.

193
00:05:33,223 --> 00:05:35,553
但当你差一点就没赶上差一点就死的体验
But when a man misses his own near-miss,

194
00:05:35,753 --> 00:05:37,783
才会真正醒悟自己错失了什么
he truly sees what he's been missing.

195
00:05:37,893 --> 00:05:39,793
我的梦想经不起等待
No more putting my dreams on hold.

196
00:05:40,193 --> 00:05:42,463
五年前 我做了一个遗愿清单
Five years ago, I made a bucket list.

197
00:05:42,523 --> 00:05:44,563
是时候开始行动了
It was time to start crossing things off.

198
00:05:48,523 --> 00:05:51,223
人生恐怖瞬间之极
Scariest moment of my life.

199
00:05:53,023 --> 00:05:55,683
天啊 我还以为失去你了
Oh, my gosh. I thought I lost you!

200
00:05:55,693 --> 00:05:58,013
但神奇的是 有好事发生了
But amazingly, something great came out of it.

201
00:05:58,083 --> 00:06:01,113
我知道姐姐对我的真感情了
I found out how my sister truly feels about me.

202
00:06:01,333 --> 00:06:02,563
姑娘们 真的吗
Girls, are you sure?

203
00:06:02,563 --> 00:06:04,573
真的 我们走回家
Positive. We'll walk home.

204
00:06:05,253 --> 00:06:06,843
我们差点就死了
We almost died.

205
00:06:06,953 --> 00:06:07,784
是啊
Yeah.

206
00:06:08,073 --> 00:06:09,613
你在车里说的那句...
A-about what you said in the car...

207
00:06:09,613 --> 00:06:11,733
拜托现在不要取笑我
Please don't make fun of me right now.

208
00:06:11,733 --> 00:06:13,283
没 我永远不会取笑你的
No, I would never.

209
00:06:13,283 --> 00:06:14,603
其实你说得好坦诚
It was actually really honest.

210
00:06:14,603 --> 00:06:17,483
我不该再挖苦你的智商了
And I need to stop taking shots at your intelligence.

211
00:06:18,073 --> 00:06:19,473
你也不是经常那样做
You don't do it that often.

212
00:06:19,473 --> 00:06:21,373
因为很多次你都没听出来
Well, you miss a lot of it.

213
00:06:22,033 --> 00:06:23,154
看哪 我又那样做了
There, I did it again.

214
00:06:23,163 --> 00:06:23,874
做什么了
Did what?

215
00:06:23,933 --> 00:06:25,343
无关紧要
Uh, it doesn't matter.

216
00:06:25,673 --> 00:06:27,933
我一直认为你是很自私的人
I always considered you to be this self-absorbed person,

217
00:06:27,933 --> 00:06:30,464
不过其实你挺有深度的 是吧
but you're more substantial than that, aren't you?

218
00:06:31,124 --> 00:06:32,145
谢谢你
Thank you.

219
00:06:32,294 --> 00:06:34,444
这样吧 我今天不去学柔道了
You know what? I'm blowing off judo today.

220
00:06:34,444 --> 00:06:35,285
我们一起玩
Let's hang out.

221
00:06:35,674 --> 00:06:36,765
我们做什么好呢
What should we do?

222
00:06:36,804 --> 00:06:37,935
给你改变造型
Makeovers.

223
00:06:39,054 --> 00:06:39,865
好吧
Okay.

224
00:06:40,284 --> 00:06:41,014
太好了
Great!

225
00:06:41,014 --> 00:06:43,144
我们会路过我做蜜蜡脱毛的地方
We're gonna walk right past my waxing place.

226
00:06:43,144 --> 00:06:45,564
跟你的女士小胡须说再见吧
Say goodbye to that gal stache.

227
00:06:50,764 --> 00:06:52,724
如果舒服的话 那所有人都是辣妹了
If it were easy, everyone would be hot.

228
00:06:52,724 --> 00:06:54,414
是 但不仅是高跟鞋让我的脚疼
Yep, you know, I-it's not just my feet.

229
00:06:54,414 --> 00:06:56,584
是我不慎撞到了停车标志牌上面
It's from when I walked into the stop sign

230
00:06:56,584 --> 00:06:57,294
因为你不肯还给我...
because you wouldn't give me back my --

231
00:06:57,294 --> 00:07:00,844
好吧 把你的眼镜还给你 拿着
Okay, fine. I'll give you back your man-goggles. Here.

232
00:07:00,944 --> 00:07:02,144
我只是以为回家的路上
I just thought we might run into

233
00:07:02,144 --> 00:07:03,934
我们可能会遇到几个帅哥
some cute boys on the way home,

234
00:07:03,934 --> 00:07:05,594
不过 幸好没有遇到
but it's probably best we didn't.

235
00:07:05,594 --> 00:07:07,894
你的嘴唇又红又肿
That's a pretty angry lip you got there.

236
00:07:07,924 --> 00:07:08,755
真的吗
Really?

237
00:07:11,994 --> 00:07:13,154
别人都会这么红吗
Does everybody's get this red?

238
00:07:13,154 --> 00:07:15,294
你的汗毛太多了
Well, you had quite a bit of growth.

239
00:07:15,294 --> 00:07:17,554
我本来还想让那个女人处理一下你的胳膊
I was gonna have that lady take a crack at your arms,

240
00:07:17,554 --> 00:07:19,444
不过她的围裙都被汗湿透了
but she had already sweat through her apron.

241
00:07:19,574 --> 00:07:21,164
天呐
Oh, my gosh!

242
00:07:21,204 --> 00:07:23,944
我新指甲的照片已经得到一百个赞了
I already have 100 likes on my picture of my new nails.

243
00:07:23,944 --> 00:07:26,794
告诉你一声 照片背景里好像有我
Um, FYI, I'm -- I'm sort of in the background there,

244
00:07:26,794 --> 00:07:28,364
脱毛时尖叫的样子
screaming mid-wax.

245
00:07:28,524 --> 00:07:31,304
四百个人对此照片点赞
400 people liked this photo.

246
00:07:31,344 --> 00:07:32,785
我不是其中之一
I was not one of them.

247
00:07:32,934 --> 00:07:33,524
我的美术老师
My art teacher

248
00:07:33,524 --> 00:07:34,904
留了个关于"蓝调时期"的短评
made a pithy "Blue period" comment,

249
00:07:34,904 --> 00:07:36,364
而我的头号候选舞会舞伴
and my top prom prospect

250
00:07:36,364 --> 00:07:38,404
突然找了个加拿大女朋友
suddenly found a girlfriend in Canada.

251
00:07:38,974 --> 00:07:41,004
你能不能把运动鞋还给我
Do you think I could get my sneakers back?

252
00:07:41,004 --> 00:07:43,304
你去试衣服的时候
Ohh, I threw them away with the rest of your clothes

253
00:07:43,304 --> 00:07:44,774
我把你的鞋和衣服都扔了
when you were in the changing room.

254
00:07:44,774 --> 00:07:46,604
我本来想把它们送给管家的
I thought about saving them for the housekeeper,

255
00:07:46,604 --> 00:07:48,634
可我不记得她是不是有儿子
but I couldn't remember if she had a son.

256
00:07:48,634 --> 00:07:51,874
听着 我已经很努力地在忍受你...
Look, I've tried really hard to put up with a lot since...

257
00:07:52,394 --> 00:07:53,174
怎么了
What's going on?

258
00:07:53,174 --> 00:07:55,374
跟你在一起真开心
Oh, I just had so much fun with you!

259
00:07:55,374 --> 00:07:57,134
我们一起玩的机会太少了
We don't do this enough.

260
00:07:57,134 --> 00:07:59,724
真希望有什么可以让你教我的
I just wish there was something that you could teach me.

261
00:08:01,314 --> 00:08:02,894
等等 你教我柔道怎么样
Wait, what about your judo stuff?

262
00:08:02,894 --> 00:08:04,524
你不会感兴趣的
Uh you're not interested in that.

263
00:08:04,524 --> 00:08:07,024
才不是 我有兴趣 来嘛
No! No! I am! Come on!

264
00:08:07,024 --> 00:08:08,964
来个斜劈还是什么的
Karate-chop me or something!

265
00:08:08,964 --> 00:08:09,504
那不是...
That is not --

266
00:08:09,504 --> 00:08:10,844
好吧 我教你
Okay. All right.

267
00:08:10,844 --> 00:08:12,404
我们先做一个简单的动作
Let's just do one simple move.

268
00:08:12,404 --> 00:08:13,234
好的
Okay.

269
00:08:13,234 --> 00:08:15,224
不会弄皱我的上衣吧
Now, this won't wrinkle my top, will it?

270
00:08:18,544 --> 00:08:20,274
这可太有意思了
That was actually fun!

271
00:08:20,274 --> 00:08:21,544
再教我一次
Show me one more time.

272
00:08:21,544 --> 00:08:22,555
不
Oh, no!

273
00:08:22,714 --> 00:08:24,725
天呐 我以为又失去你了呢
Oh, my gosh. I thought I lost you again.

274
00:08:24,855 --> 00:08:26,905
等等 倒回去 又是怎么回事
Wait, wait, wait. Back up. Again?

275
00:08:26,905 --> 00:08:28,515
是啊 差点出车祸的时候
Oh, yeah, when we almost got killed,

276
00:08:28,515 --> 00:08:29,685
我以为把手机摔坏了
I thought I lost my phone.

277
00:08:29,685 --> 00:08:31,745
那可真恐怖
It was really scary.

278
00:08:31,745 --> 00:08:34,935
曼妥思喷射器 第二次测试
Mentos-pramp-climb, test number two.

279
00:08:34,935 --> 00:08:37,605
经验教训 当压力达到危险等级
Lesson learned -- when pressure builds to dangerous levels,

280
00:08:37,605 --> 00:08:39,425
必须得到释放
it must be released.

281
00:08:42,085 --> 00:08:44,845
是你的嘴好些了 还是你的脸变红了
Is your lip getting better or your face getting redder?

282
00:08:53,935 --> 00:08:56,125
我去客厅啦
Just gonna pop into the family room.

283
00:08:56,805 --> 00:08:58,693
你在搞什么
What the hell was that?!

284
00:08:58,693 --> 00:09:00,805
这才刚刚开始呢
Oh, I'm just getting started!

285
00:09:00,805 --> 00:09:01,975
为什么你要这样傻...
Why do you have to be such a silly --

286
00:09:01,975 --> 00:09:03,045
海莉 住手
Haley, stop!

287
00:09:03,045 --> 00:09:04,446
妈妈
Mom!

288
00:09:07,515 --> 00:09:09,165
菲尔 亲爱的
Phil, honey.

289
00:09:13,995 --> 00:09:15,555
我本来就心情沉重
I was already on edge.

290
00:09:15,555 --> 00:09:17,555
前一天 我和妈妈在公园
The day before, I was with my mom at the park

291
00:09:17,555 --> 00:09:19,885
有个骑自行车的人抢走了她的手机
when some guy on a bike swiped her phone.

292
00:09:20,085 --> 00:09:22,265
他一定是个惯犯
He must have been a criminal mastermind.

293
00:09:22,265 --> 00:09:23,975
只那一秒她没在给乔拍照
He struck the one second she wasn't

294
00:09:23,975 --> 00:09:25,236
就被他抓住了
taking pictures of Joe.

295
00:09:25,615 --> 00:09:28,105
最糟的是 我眼看着他抢走手机
The worst part is, I saw him grab it.

296
00:09:28,105 --> 00:09:29,205
我本来有机会做点什么
I had a chance to do something

297
00:09:29,205 --> 00:09:32,115
在妈妈面前做个英雄的 可我僵住了
and be a hero to my mom, but I froze.

298
00:09:32,115 --> 00:09:33,225
你会怎么做
What would you have done,

299
00:09:33,225 --> 00:09:35,795
使他成为讽刺漫画的主角吗
made him the subject of a satirical cartoon?

300
00:09:35,795 --> 00:09:38,215
那些漫画曾扳倒过总统
Hey! Uh, they've taken down presidents.

301
00:09:38,215 --> 00:09:39,685
你能不能支持我一下
Now, can you just support me here?

302
00:09:39,685 --> 00:09:42,145
并没有多少机会可以让儿子为...
There are only so many moments a son has a chance to --

303
00:09:42,145 --> 00:09:43,765
真成熟
Very mature.

304
00:09:43,765 --> 00:09:45,265
挑起事端 然后又不理我了吗
Pick a fight then tune me out?

305
00:09:45,265 --> 00:09:47,425
我才不在乎 停下
It's not bothering me. Stop it!

306
00:09:47,425 --> 00:09:49,465
爸爸 音乐声调小点
Dad, turn down that song!

307
00:09:49,465 --> 00:09:50,917
*办不到*
*No can do.*

308
00:09:50,917 --> 00:09:55,305
你确定吗 曼尼
You sure, Manny?

309
00:09:55,305 --> 00:09:57,005
是的 我走回家
Positive. I-I'll walk home.

310
00:10:00,005 --> 00:10:02,555
-我们差点死了 -是啊
- We almost died. - Yeah.

311
00:10:02,605 --> 00:10:03,506
白人
White.

312
00:10:03,815 --> 00:10:05,156
是的 我确定
Yes, I'm sure.

313
00:10:05,875 --> 00:10:07,315
有那么难想象犯罪的是白人吗
Why is it so hard for you to imagine

314
00:10:07,315 --> 00:10:09,715
就算大多数罪犯都是...
that a criminal can be white when most of the --

315
00:10:09,805 --> 00:10:11,306
你说单车的颜色啊
Ah, the bicycle.

316
00:10:11,645 --> 00:10:13,065
是的 是白色
Yes, yes, it was white.

317
00:10:13,065 --> 00:10:14,755
你手机不是被偷了吗
I thought your phone got stolen?

318
00:10:14,755 --> 00:10:15,926
这是乔的手机
This is Joe's phone.

319
00:10:15,926 --> 00:10:18,216
所以恐怖分子才痛恨我们
This is why the terrorists hate us.

320
00:10:19,966 --> 00:10:22,066
整个世界冰冷无情
The universe is cold and unfeeling.

321
00:10:22,066 --> 00:10:23,706
唯一不变的只有混乱
The only constant is chaos.

322
00:10:23,706 --> 00:10:26,216
巧克力薄饼又卖光了吗
Was that place out of chocolate-chip pancakes again?

323
00:10:26,656 --> 00:10:28,766
我们差点被卡车撞死
We were all almost killed by a truck.

324
00:10:28,766 --> 00:10:30,296
我的天啊 你没事吧 宝贝
Ay Dios mio! Are you okay, papi?

325
00:10:30,296 --> 00:10:31,686
都是菲尔的错对吧
This was all Phil's fault, wasn't it?

326
00:10:31,686 --> 00:10:34,066
他老是听那种该死的新潮音乐
He's always blaring that damn new wave music!

327
00:10:34,066 --> 00:10:36,346
不 他急转弯避开了
No. He swerved to avoid it.

328
00:10:36,346 --> 00:10:37,856
救了我的命
Saved my life.

329
00:10:37,876 --> 00:10:39,646
不过生命无法自主
But the game of life is rigged.

330
00:10:39,646 --> 00:10:40,906
死亡不可避免
Death always win.

331
00:10:40,906 --> 00:10:42,516
好了 我知道你现在需要什么
Okay, I know what you need right now --

332
00:10:42,516 --> 00:10:43,856
去冰淇淋店
A trip to the ice-cream shop.

333
00:10:43,856 --> 00:10:45,206
他不需要冰淇淋
He doesn't need ice cream.

334
00:10:45,206 --> 00:10:46,576
他要讲讲刚才发生的事
He needs to talk about what just happened to him.

335
00:10:46,576 --> 00:10:48,706
我可以去吃点冰淇淋的
Well, I could go for some ice cream.

336
00:10:49,386 --> 00:10:51,656
我知道怎么安慰我儿子
I know how to fix my son.

337
00:10:52,416 --> 00:10:53,746
就这么安慰吗
So, this is fixed.

338
00:10:56,026 --> 00:10:57,387
绕过去
Go around.

339
00:10:58,516 --> 00:11:00,036
平时为了尊重你
Normally, I'd be avoiding these cracks

340
00:11:00,036 --> 00:11:01,776
我都尽量避免这样的时刻
out of respect of your back, Mom,

341
00:11:01,776 --> 00:11:03,306
可过了今天好像都没有意义了
But after today, it seems pointless.

342
00:11:03,306 --> 00:11:04,616
够了 上车
That's it. Get in.

343
00:11:04,616 --> 00:11:06,006
不要 杰 他害怕
No, Jay, he's afraid!

344
00:11:06,006 --> 00:11:06,956
这样只会更糟
It's only gonna get worse.

345
00:11:06,956 --> 00:11:08,676
上车 相信我
In. Trust me.

346
00:11:08,676 --> 00:11:11,336
上车五分钟他就会春光灿烂了
Five minutes in here, he'll be happy as a clam.

347
00:11:14,246 --> 00:11:14,946
妈妈呀
Aah! Mama!

348
00:11:14,946 --> 00:11:15,666
冷静
Calm down.

349
00:11:15,666 --> 00:11:16,857
这主意很烂
This was a bad idea.

350
00:11:17,216 --> 00:11:17,736
下车
Hop out.

351
00:11:17,736 --> 00:11:20,206
这就对了 杰 要等他准备好
Good for you, Jay. It has to be when he is ready.

352
00:11:20,206 --> 00:11:21,256
-不 他来开 -什么
- Nope. He's driving. - What?

353
00:11:21,256 --> 00:11:22,176
什么 我做不到
What? I-I can't.

354
00:11:22,176 --> 00:11:23,656
你给我开
You're doing it now.

355
00:11:23,656 --> 00:11:25,776
神啊 开车吧
Jesus, take the wheel.

356
00:11:25,866 --> 00:11:27,296
他坐后面就够害怕的了
He's terrified to be in the back.

357
00:11:27,296 --> 00:11:29,466
现在你要让他坐前座
Now you're gonna put him in the front seat

358
00:11:29,466 --> 00:11:30,916
这样他就能把我们都弄死了
so that he can kill all of us?!

359
00:11:30,916 --> 00:11:32,636
你能别火上浇油了吗
Can you not make this fear worse?

360
00:11:32,636 --> 00:11:34,516
我看过米奇尔怕黑的时候
I watched Dede coddle Mitchell

361
00:11:34,516 --> 00:11:35,906
迪迪是怎么过分呵护他的
when he was afraid of the dark.

362
00:11:35,906 --> 00:11:38,776
他到七岁还是眨眼每次只眨一边
Till he was seven, he'd only blink one eye at a time --

363
00:11:38,866 --> 00:11:40,926
害得不少女生误会了
gave a lot of girls a very wrong idea.

364
00:11:43,276 --> 00:11:45,016
曼尼 你不想这么做对吧
Manny, you don't want to do this right?

365
00:11:45,016 --> 00:11:46,396
不 我不想
No, I really don't.

366
00:11:46,396 --> 00:11:48,356
好的 宝贝 要不我们换吧
Okay, papi, you know what? Let's switch.

367
00:11:48,356 --> 00:11:49,806
我来开
I'm going to drive.

368
00:11:49,976 --> 00:11:51,276
妈妈 我很怕[我有个美人儿]
I've got a bombshell, mom.

369
00:11:51,276 --> 00:11:53,656
宝贝 多谢 但是我们这个姿势
Ay, papi, thank you, but this is a very weird thing

370
00:11:53,656 --> 00:11:55,406
说这种话太诡异了
to say when we're in this position.

371
00:11:55,406 --> 00:11:57,746
不 我决定永远不开车了
No, I've decided I'm never driving.

372
00:11:58,446 --> 00:11:59,487
不行
No way.

373
00:11:59,526 --> 00:12:01,356
你坐这 你坐那
You there. You there.

374
00:12:01,356 --> 00:12:02,456
按我说的做
We're doing this my way.

375
00:12:02,456 --> 00:12:04,146
每次都是要么按你说的做
Ah, yeah, 'cause it's your way

376
00:12:04,146 --> 00:12:05,836
要么就滚蛋[上高速]
or the highway.

377
00:12:05,836 --> 00:12:07,136
天啊 不要上高速
Oh, God. Not the highway.

378
00:12:07,136 --> 00:12:08,497
你一直让我像个父亲一样教导他
You always want me to be his dad.

379
00:12:08,497 --> 00:12:09,567
我这不是在做吗
Well, I'm being his dad.

380
00:12:09,567 --> 00:12:11,717
我真的好怕 杰
Oh, uh, I-I'm really scared, Jay.

381
00:12:11,717 --> 00:12:13,058
这就是我们要解决的问题
This is what we're fixing.

382
00:12:13,557 --> 00:12:15,607
我还是个孩子的时候
Look, when I was a kid,

383
00:12:15,607 --> 00:12:18,227
住在一个巨大的吓人的黑色湖旁
I lived by a big, scary black lake.

384
00:12:18,597 --> 00:12:20,677
我一直觉得湖里有怪兽
I always thought there monsters in there and whatnot.

385
00:12:20,677 --> 00:12:23,437
一天晚上 我爸把我拉下床
One night, my dad dragged me out of bed

386
00:12:23,437 --> 00:12:25,437
然后直接把我踹进湖里
and tossed me right in that cold water.

387
00:12:25,437 --> 00:12:27,457
然后我就再也不怕那个湖了
I was never scared of that lake again.

388
00:12:28,457 --> 00:12:29,638
踩油门吧
Now, give it some gas.

389
00:12:35,127 --> 00:12:35,857
妈妈啊
Mma! Aah!

390
00:12:35,857 --> 00:12:37,527
这个喊妈妈的习惯也要改一下
That's another habit I wouldn't mind breaking,

391
00:12:37,527 --> 00:12:40,807
不过我们现在必须要
but, you know, right now we...have to...

392
00:12:41,757 --> 00:12:42,888
我在干什么呢
Oh, what am I doing?

393
00:12:43,307 --> 00:12:44,967
我讨厌我爸那样对我
I hated my dad for that.

394
00:12:45,307 --> 00:12:47,437
最后我怕的不是湖 变成他了
I ended up scared of him, not the lake.

395
00:12:48,437 --> 00:12:49,127
曼尼 没事
Manny, - it's okay.

396
00:12:49,127 --> 00:12:50,807
那边 骑车那个
Over there! On the bike!

397
00:12:50,807 --> 00:12:52,737
是偷我手机的那个白人
The white guy that stole my phone!

398
00:12:52,737 --> 00:12:53,627
我没看到有人
I don't see anyone.

399
00:12:53,627 --> 00:12:55,477
就是他 他刚拐弯
Yes! He just turned the corner!

400
00:12:55,477 --> 00:12:58,367
偷手机贼 他要逃走了
The phone burglar! He's getting away!

401
00:12:58,367 --> 00:12:59,667
这一次不会了
Not this time.

402
00:12:59,667 --> 00:13:01,157
前面左转
Up there to the left!

403
00:13:07,797 --> 00:13:09,278
我什么人都没看到
I don't see anyone!

404
00:13:09,327 --> 00:13:11,667
我也没看到 我乱说的
I didn't see anyone either. I made it up.

405
00:13:11,667 --> 00:13:12,377
我可不要
I am not going to

406
00:13:12,377 --> 00:13:15,227
到了儿子40岁时还得开车载他
drive my son around until he's 40.

407
00:13:15,327 --> 00:13:18,247
唯一能战胜曼尼的恐惧的
The only thing stronger than Manny's fear

408
00:13:18,247 --> 00:13:20,737
是他保护他的妈妈的愿望
is his need to protect his mama.

409
00:13:20,737 --> 00:13:23,377
不 他跑了
Oh, no! He got away!

410
00:13:23,377 --> 00:13:25,327
但是你做得很不错
But you did very good, Manny.

411
00:13:25,327 --> 00:13:27,097
我刚刚开得超快
That was a frickin' rush!

412
00:13:27,097 --> 00:13:29,097
但我不会放弃 我们会抓到那个人的
But we're not giving up. We're gonna find that guy.

413
00:13:29,097 --> 00:13:29,958
不
No!

414
00:13:30,117 --> 00:13:30,967
你确定要这样吗
Are you sure about this?

415
00:13:30,967 --> 00:13:32,697
你们走吧 我走路回家
Just go. I'm walking home.

416
00:13:35,517 --> 00:13:36,517
我听不见他说话 太吵了
I can't even hear him, it's so loud.

417
00:13:36,517 --> 00:13:38,407
你们能闭嘴吗
Can everybody just shut up?!

418
00:13:38,407 --> 00:13:41,297
-你好 -请问是菲尔·邓垃圾桶吗
- Hello. - Hello. Is this Phil Dumpster?

419
00:13:41,557 --> 00:13:42,597
干嘛 格尔
What do you want, Gil?

420
00:13:42,597 --> 00:13:44,257
没搞错吧 等等
Got to be kidding me. Hang on.

421
00:13:44,257 --> 00:13:45,337
是你的极品娇妻在说话吗
Is that your hot wife I hear?

422
00:13:45,337 --> 00:13:46,887
她还在上那些瑜伽课吗
Hey, is she still taking those yoga classes?

423
00:13:46,887 --> 00:13:47,447
我要挂了
Hanging up.

424
00:13:47,447 --> 00:13:48,617
等等 就说一句话
W-w-wait. Wait. Real quick.

425
00:13:48,617 --> 00:13:51,647
锡达街225号的房子归我管了
The listing at 225 Cedar Street,it's mine now.

426
00:13:51,647 --> 00:13:52,857
你居然偷了我的房子
You poached my listing?

427
00:13:52,857 --> 00:13:54,397
不仅偷了 还给它调了味
Poached it, seasoned it,

428
00:13:54,397 --> 00:13:57,757
顺便加了索普蛋白酱呢 哥们
and covered it in Thorpe-andaise sauce, my friend.

429
00:13:57,757 --> 00:13:58,777
你该谢谢我 傻邓
You should thank me, dumpy.

430
00:13:58,777 --> 00:13:59,627
你又退居二线了
You're back in second place

431
00:13:59,627 --> 00:14:00,978
不过你还能看到美景
with your favorite view...

432
00:14:00,978 --> 00:14:02,408
那就是我的后背
my sweet behind.

433
00:14:02,468 --> 00:14:05,998
为什么事情一碰到他就都这么麻烦
Why does everything with him have to be so dramatic?

434
00:14:08,598 --> 00:14:09,848
我们为什么要停下来
Why are we stopping?

435
00:14:11,888 --> 00:14:15,158
天呐 我以为我失去你了
Oh, my God! I thought I lost you.

436
00:14:16,348 --> 00:14:16,938
能说什么呢
What's to tell?

437
00:14:16,938 --> 00:14:18,848
卡车开过了停车标示 我避开了卡车
A truck runs a stop sign, I avoid it,

438
00:14:18,848 --> 00:14:22,008
大家都走开了 有惊无险
everyone walks away, bing, bang, no boom.

439
00:14:22,008 --> 00:14:23,888
-那可是辆卡车 -太吓人了
- There was a truck! - That was crazy!

440
00:14:23,888 --> 00:14:28,158
大家都冷静一下 别激动
Everybody calm down. Calm down. Let's not overreact.

441
00:14:28,158 --> 00:14:28,948
-你说什么 -老爸
- What?! - Dad!

442
00:14:28,948 --> 00:14:30,718
-我们差点就死了 -是啊
- We were almost just killed! - Yes!

443
00:14:30,718 --> 00:14:33,628
没错 差点 也就是说我们都没事
Exactly. Almost, which means we're all just fine.

444
00:14:33,658 --> 00:14:35,058
你就没有一点点后怕吗
You aren't the least bit upset?

445
00:14:35,058 --> 00:14:36,768
今天早上我吃的华夫饼上有奶油笑脸
It's gonna take more than that to ruin a morning

446
00:14:36,768 --> 00:14:39,148
要毁掉这样美好的早晨可没这么容易
that started with a whipped-cream smile on my waffle.

447
00:14:39,148 --> 00:14:40,878
其实我是受了点影响
Okay, it may have affected me a little,

448
00:14:40,878 --> 00:14:43,148
但有时要明白自己的感受并不容易
but sometimes it's hard to know what you're feeling.

449
00:14:43,368 --> 00:14:45,028
我当时在想之后的壁球训练
Mostly, I was thinking about racquetball later

450
00:14:45,028 --> 00:14:47,488
我要给小卡狠狠来一招
and hopefully giving Cam a nice spanking.

451
00:14:47,618 --> 00:14:49,898
说明一下 今早的壁球训练
Fair warning, may be working out some anger issues

452
00:14:49,898 --> 00:14:51,288
我可能要发泄一下情绪
on the racquetball court this morning.

453
00:14:51,288 --> 00:14:52,728
-别问原因 -没问题
- Don't ask. - Sounds good.

454
00:14:52,728 --> 00:14:54,238
我们新买的烘干机到了
So, we're getting our new dryer delivered.

455
00:14:54,238 --> 00:14:55,448
应该是蛋壳白色的
It's supposed to be eggshell,

456
00:14:55,448 --> 00:14:57,688
但送来的不是蛋壳白 是纯白色
but, oh, it's not eggshell, it's white.

457
00:14:57,688 --> 00:15:00,188
我当时正在跟送货员吵架
Anyway, I'm laying into the delivery driver,

458
00:15:00,188 --> 00:15:03,078
结果米奇尔插进来说"没关系"
and Mitchell strolls in and says, "Oh, it's fine,"

459
00:15:03,078 --> 00:15:05,878
还给送货员一块香蕉面包
and then offers him a piece of his banana loaf.

460
00:15:05,878 --> 00:15:06,788
真是气人
I heard that.

461
00:15:06,788 --> 00:15:08,338
哪怕一次也好 我希望
Just once, I would like

462
00:15:08,338 --> 00:15:09,468
米奇尔站在我这边
Mitchell to take my side.

463
00:15:09,468 --> 00:15:11,308
每次我都会替他说话
I am constantly strolling in and saving him

464
00:15:11,308 --> 00:15:12,848
就像拯救困在塔中的公主
like a little princess in the tower.

465
00:15:12,848 --> 00:15:14,588
有时候我也想当公主
Sometimes I'd like to be the princess.

466
00:15:14,588 --> 00:15:16,368
-怎样都是一样 对吧 -什么
- Six of one, right? - What?

467
00:15:16,398 --> 00:15:18,468
我们为什么在这里停
Why are, why are we stopping?

468
00:15:18,888 --> 00:15:21,048
我不明白 菲利普
I'm-I'm very confused, Phillip.

469
00:15:21,308 --> 00:15:23,928
相信我 这房子会以索普光速卖出的
Trust me, this house is gonna sell at Thorpe speed.

470
00:15:24,268 --> 00:15:25,368
你们好
Hey, guys.

471
00:15:25,368 --> 00:15:27,538
-菲尔 -看来你知道了 抱歉
- Oh, hey, Phil. - I guess you heard. I'm sorry.

472
00:15:27,538 --> 00:15:29,728
没关系 这事时有发生
Oh, no, it happens all the time.

473
00:15:29,748 --> 00:15:31,568
我就是过来给你们一点良心建议
I just stopped by to give you guys a little care package

474
00:15:31,568 --> 00:15:33,168
以证明我完全没有介怀
to show you there's no hard feelings.

475
00:15:33,168 --> 00:15:34,508
非常有绅士风度 邓菲虫
Class act, Dung beetle.

476
00:15:34,508 --> 00:15:36,178
这是专攻不法行为案件的律师的名片
Here's the Malpractice Attorney

477
00:15:36,178 --> 00:15:38,848
大部分他的客户受到伤害后都找这个律师
most of his clients have used after he's ripped them off.

478
00:15:38,848 --> 00:15:40,118
你们可能会失眠
You will be losing some sleep,

479
00:15:40,118 --> 00:15:41,928
这种药总能帮我妻子入睡
but these have always helped my wife.

480
00:15:41,928 --> 00:15:43,688
这个神父已经退休了
And this priest is retired,

481
00:15:43,688 --> 00:15:45,538
但他应该还在主持驱魔活动
but I think he still does exorcisms,

482
00:15:45,538 --> 00:15:47,128
今天过后你们会需要的
which you'll need after today.

483
00:15:47,188 --> 00:15:48,688
-菲尔 -没关系的
- Listen, Phil—- - It’s okay.

484
00:15:48,688 --> 00:15:51,948
看见一个曾经中庸的地产经纪堕落如此
It's sad, really, to see a once-mediocre realtor

485
00:15:51,948 --> 00:15:52,688
也挺让人伤心的
reduced to this.

486
00:15:52,688 --> 00:15:54,629
格尔 别这样 好好说话
Gil, please, let's keep this civil.

487
00:15:54,629 --> 00:15:56,999
还有 如果你再对我老婆出言不敬
Oh, by the way, if you ever speak disrespectfully again

488
00:15:56,999 --> 00:15:58,500
我会杀了你
about my wife, I'll kill you.

489
00:15:58,639 --> 00:16:00,439
抱歉 我说得好像这是个玩笑
Sorry. That sounded like a joke.

490
00:16:00,439 --> 00:16:02,119
我真的会杀了你
I will actually kill you.

491
00:16:03,489 --> 00:16:05,179
总之 如果你们能清醒过来
Anyhow, when you guys wake up

492
00:16:05,179 --> 00:16:06,349
闻到硫磺的味道
and smell the sulfur,

493
00:16:06,349 --> 00:16:07,989
这是其它地产经纪的名单
here's a list of other realtors,

494
00:16:07,989 --> 00:16:10,509
如果想找我 我九点上班
and if you need me, I'll be in the office at 9:00,

495
00:16:10,589 --> 00:16:12,399
还是十点吧 我要去看牙医
10:00. I have the dentist.

496
00:16:12,749 --> 00:16:14,069
这是怎么回事
Where did that come from?

497
00:16:14,069 --> 00:16:15,909
人生苦短 不能被恐惧操控
Life's too short to be ruled by fear.

498
00:16:15,909 --> 00:16:16,709
公主 我们去
What do you say

499
00:16:16,709 --> 00:16:18,319
把你想要的那台烘干机要来怎样
we get you the right dryer, princess?

500
00:16:19,179 --> 00:16:20,270
天呐
Oh, my.

501
00:16:20,569 --> 00:16:22,359
菲尔平常很...
I mean, Phil is usually just so...

502
00:16:22,359 --> 00:16:24,879
但那天他很...
but then he was just, like, so...

503
00:16:24,879 --> 00:16:26,829
接着还变得更...
and then he got even more...

504
00:16:27,129 --> 00:16:28,049
我无能为力
There's nothing I can do.

505
00:16:28,049 --> 00:16:30,309
-我不接受 -办不到
- I can't go for that. - No can do.

506
00:16:30,309 --> 00:16:32,359
卡梅隆买了一台蛋壳白的烘干机
Cameron here bought an eggshell dryer.

507
00:16:32,359 --> 00:16:33,569
不是纯白 不是燕麦色
Not white, not oatmeal,

508
00:16:33,569 --> 00:16:34,559
不是瑞士咖啡白
not Swiss-coffee,

509
00:16:34,559 --> 00:16:35,909
不是爽身粉白 也不是骨白
not baby-powder, not bone.

510
00:16:35,909 --> 00:16:38,479
是蛋壳白 你叫罗伯是吧[抢劫]
Eggshell. Look, Rob, is it?

511
00:16:38,479 --> 00:16:39,779
这名字真有趣
That's interesting.

512
00:16:39,779 --> 00:16:41,449
接下来是这样
Here's how this is going down--

513
00:16:41,719 --> 00:16:43,689
没有蛋壳白的烘干机我们不会走
we don't leave without that eggshell dryer.

514
00:16:43,689 --> 00:16:45,809
不是天鹅羽毛白 不是切斯特猪白
Not swan-feather, not chester-pig-white.

515
00:16:45,809 --> 00:16:47,450
颜色已经说得够清楚了
I think we've covered the colors.

516
00:16:47,959 --> 00:16:49,329
我每天都卖房子给不同的人
I sell houses to people every day

517
00:16:49,329 --> 00:16:51,209
他们会问我去哪买烘干机比较好
who ask me where they should buy their dryer.

518
00:16:51,349 --> 00:16:54,439
你不希望我告诉他们哪家不能去吧
I don't think you want me giving them any static.

519
00:16:54,749 --> 00:16:56,390
后面可能还有一台
I may have one in the back.

520
00:16:56,469 --> 00:16:58,429
但要两个人把它从车上搬下来
But it takes two guys to load the truck,

521
00:16:58,429 --> 00:16:59,849
今天这里只有我一人
and it's just me today.

522
00:16:59,849 --> 00:17:00,820
是吗
Is it?

523
00:17:00,899 --> 00:17:01,959
就在那电光火石的一瞬
It was right about then

524
00:17:01,959 --> 00:17:04,679
我的心头涌上一个问题
that a question started nagging at me.

525
00:17:19,209 --> 00:17:20,539
菲尔性感吗
Is Phil sexy?

526
00:17:23,819 --> 00:17:25,379
你想跟我做点疯狂的事吗
You feel like doing something a little crazy with me?

527
00:17:25,379 --> 00:17:27,299
什么 不想 什么 不想
What? No. What? No.

528
00:17:27,899 --> 00:17:28,529
你好啊 亲爱的
Hey, honey.

529
00:17:28,529 --> 00:17:29,849
菲尔 亲爱的 你还好吗
Phil, honey, how you holding up?

530
00:17:29,849 --> 00:17:30,359
挺好的
Good.

531
00:17:30,359 --> 00:17:32,769
我在沙滩 说来话长
I'm at the beach -- long story.

532
00:17:32,769 --> 00:17:34,039
我希望你不介意
I was hoping you wouldn't mind

533
00:17:34,039 --> 00:17:35,499
在家等着卢克的补习老师
waiting at the house for Luke's tutor.

534
00:17:35,499 --> 00:17:36,999
实际上 我挺介意的 我做不到啊
Actually, I would mind. I'd mind quite a bit.

535
00:17:36,999 --> 00:17:38,029
-我挺忙的 -好吧
- I'm kind of busy. - Okay.

536
00:17:38,029 --> 00:17:40,899
小卡 有件事是克莱尔永远不会允许的
Cam, there's something that Claire would never approve of

537
00:17:40,899 --> 00:17:42,039
但却是我一直都想做的
that I've always wanted to do.

538
00:17:42,039 --> 00:17:43,130
一直吗
Always?

539
00:17:43,219 --> 00:17:45,689
我们要在后车座上铺块毛毯
We're gonna want to put a blanket down on that backseat.

540
00:17:48,670 --> 00:17:50,000
这是个巨大的错误
This was a huge mistake.

541
00:17:50,000 --> 00:17:53,200
我跟一只多毛的秘鲁神兽被困在后车座
I am jammed in the backseat with a hairy Peruvian biter.

542
00:17:53,200 --> 00:17:55,300
简直是92年的春假情景重演
It's spring break '92 all over again!

543
00:17:55,300 --> 00:17:57,380
前方有减速带 把绳子拉紧一点
Well, speed bump coming up. Hold the leash taut.

544
00:17:57,380 --> 00:17:58,530
那样可以让它保持镇静
It's supposed to keep her calm.

545
00:17:58,530 --> 00:18:00,690
我挺走运的 这家伙不喜欢吐口水
I got lucky. I don't think this one's a spitter.

546
00:18:02,290 --> 00:18:03,020
我话说太早了
uh, I spoke too soon.

547
00:18:03,020 --> 00:18:05,100
你这样觉得吗 真是够了 快停车
You think? That's it. Pull over.

548
00:18:05,100 --> 00:18:07,330
菲尔 我也想支持你的
You know, Phil, I wanted to support you on this.

549
00:18:07,330 --> 00:18:09,200
我坚决支持在家里养牲畜
I'm a firm believer in livestock in the home,

550
00:18:09,200 --> 00:18:10,580
但你实在是太失控了
But you are out of control.

551
00:18:10,580 --> 00:18:13,330
不 一切完全在我掌控之中
No, I'm in control -- more than ever.

552
00:18:13,340 --> 00:18:14,600
如果我为了让自己称心如意
And if me getting what I want

553
00:18:14,600 --> 00:18:15,930
而给别人稍微带来了一点点麻烦
inconveniences people a little,

554
00:18:15,930 --> 00:18:17,251
随便吧
then so be it.

555
00:18:18,110 --> 00:18:19,120
它紧张了
Uh, she's nervous.

556
00:18:19,120 --> 00:18:20,690
饲养员说你该让它舔你的头发
The guy said you should let her suck on your hair.

557
00:18:20,690 --> 00:18:22,040
好了 够了 我不干了
Okay, that is it. I am done.

558
00:18:22,040 --> 00:18:25,190
一切的荒唐到此为止
Enough of this ridiculousness.

559
00:18:25,190 --> 00:18:26,590
谢你了啊 菲尔
And thank you, Phil,

560
00:18:26,590 --> 00:18:28,980
因为你让我意识到了米奇尔的好
For making me appreciate Mitchell.

561
00:18:28,980 --> 00:18:30,160
他或许是有一些缺点
He may have his faults,

562
00:18:30,160 --> 00:18:32,510
但至少他不是个疯子
but at least he's not a crazy person.

563
00:18:38,080 --> 00:18:39,860
菲尔 亲爱的
Phil, honey.

564
00:18:39,860 --> 00:18:41,130
在呢 克莱尔
Yes, Claire.

565
00:18:41,130 --> 00:18:44,040
我又搞了匹草泥马回家
I got an alpaca -- again.

566
00:18:44,040 --> 00:18:45,670
你不能发表任何不满的意见
And there's nothing you can say about it.

567
00:18:45,670 --> 00:18:47,730
我不会发表任何意见的 有什么问题啊
I'm not saying anything. What's the problem?

568
00:18:50,130 --> 00:18:51,150
妈 爸
Mom, dad!

569
00:18:51,150 --> 00:18:53,040
客厅里有头骆驼
There is a camel in the living room!

570
00:18:53,040 --> 00:18:54,191
那不是骆...
It's not a c--

571
00:18:54,440 --> 00:18:55,990
-我做不到 -好了
- I-I just can't. - Okay.

572
00:18:55,990 --> 00:18:57,910
看来你们都见过乔琳2号了吧
I see you've all met Jolene two.

573
00:18:58,000 --> 00:18:59,500
不幸的是 你妈强迫我
Sadly, the original Jolene

574
00:18:59,500 --> 00:19:00,590
退回去的那头乔琳
that your mother made me return

575
00:19:00,590 --> 00:19:03,090
被一家儿童医院残忍地收养了
was cruelly adopted by a children's hospital.

576
00:19:03,090 --> 00:19:05,520
今早那辆卡车没有把我撞死
You see, something hit me this morning

577
00:19:05,520 --> 00:19:07,510
但却把我的脑子撞开了窍
when that truck didn't hit me this morning --

578
00:19:07,510 --> 00:19:11,370
我一直都没有真正掌控自己的人生
I have not been in control of my own life.

579
00:19:11,550 --> 00:19:13,530
但那种日子到此为止了
But those days are done.

580
00:19:17,040 --> 00:19:19,190
看来我真是无法掌控任何事啊 是吧
Well, I guess I'm not in control of everything, am I?

581
00:19:20,310 --> 00:19:20,900
真有意思 不是吗
funny, isn't it?

582
00:19:20,900 --> 00:19:23,120
你可以用尽全力尝试 但是在眨眼之间
You can try and try, but in the blink of an eye...

583
00:19:25,750 --> 00:19:27,750
你可能就会失去对你重要的一切
you can lose everything that matters to you.

584
00:19:28,960 --> 00:19:30,730
爸 你还好吧
Dad, are you okay?

585
00:19:30,960 --> 00:19:32,870
你们还不明白现在的情况吗
Don't you all see what's going on here?

586
00:19:33,230 --> 00:19:35,050
老爸真的很想喝那杯牛奶
Dad really wanted that milk.

587
00:19:35,170 --> 00:19:37,910
我今天差点就失去了你们所有人
I almost lost you guys today -- all of you.

588
00:19:38,611 --> 00:19:39,411
就是那样
Just like that.

589
00:19:39,411 --> 00:19:40,711
爹地
Aw, daddy.

590
00:19:40,711 --> 00:19:41,812
亲爱的
Oh, honey.

591
00:19:42,001 --> 00:19:44,631
你一整天都在试图掌控一切
You spent the whole day trying to control everything,

592
00:19:44,631 --> 00:19:46,801
我这一整天却在试图不去掌控任何事
and I spent the entire day trying not to,

593
00:19:46,801 --> 00:19:48,441
但两种方法都没奏效 不是吗
and neither way worked, did it?

594
00:19:48,441 --> 00:19:49,202
是没有
Nope.

595
00:19:50,241 --> 00:19:51,271
我或许会跟你唱反调
I may fight you on this,

596
00:19:51,271 --> 00:19:54,041
但我需要你强迫我把乔琳2号也退回去
but I'm gonna need you to make me get rid of Jolene two.

597
00:19:54,141 --> 00:19:56,401
-它很凶悍 -我知道
- She's a biter. - I know.

598
00:19:56,641 --> 00:19:59,311
不过要等我们先拥抱完才行
As soon as we're done with this hug.

599
00:19:59,351 --> 00:20:00,491
嘿 不管你们在干什么
Hey, whatever this is,

600
00:20:00,491 --> 00:20:01,542
我都必须参与一下
I need to get in on it.

601
00:20:02,311 --> 00:20:03,391
我今天差点死了
I almost died today.

602
00:20:03,391 --> 00:20:05,311
-外公 -爸
- Grandpa. - Daddy.

603
00:20:05,621 --> 00:20:07,182
爸啊
Aw, dad.

604
00:20:08,051 --> 00:20:09,022
快过来
Come here.

605
00:20:10,251 --> 00:20:11,512
都过来
Come here, you.

606
00:20:14,531 --> 00:20:16,701
去驾校学学开车啊 婆娘
Learn how to drive, lady!

607
00:20:18,891 --> 00:20:20,171
等我准备好了再去开会
I will get to the meeting when I get there.

608
00:20:20,171 --> 00:20:21,971
我今天和死神擦肩而过
I looked death in the face today.

609
00:20:22,111 --> 00:20:25,081
喂 好的 我想留个言
Hel-- hello. Yes, I would like to leave a message.

610
00:20:25,081 --> 00:20:27,801
我丈夫之前预定了一台蛋壳色烘干机
My husband ordered an eggshell dryer --

611
00:20:28,051 --> 00:20:29,891
不是爽身粉 不是羊皮纸
Not talc, not parchment

612
00:20:29,891 --> 00:20:31,292
是蛋壳色的
-- eggshell.

613
00:20:32,521 --> 00:20:34,111
你今天回来要早些啊 这是怎么了
You're home early. What happened to you?

614
00:20:34,111 --> 00:20:35,011
那不重要
Doesn't matter.

615
00:20:35,011 --> 00:20:36,581
我打电话给那个家电卖场了
So, I called that appliance store,

616
00:20:36,581 --> 00:20:37,501
我要求他们务必
And I demanded that

617
00:20:37,501 --> 00:20:39,091
把你想要的那台烘干机送到
you get the dryer that you wanted.

618
00:20:40,661 --> 00:20:41,531
你的强硬态度一定奏效了
Oh, well, it must've worked

619
00:20:41,531 --> 00:20:43,771
因为他们现在正把那台发错货的搬走呢
because they're taking away the wrong one right now.

620
00:20:43,771 --> 00:20:45,451
愿意随时为你效劳 小公主
Anything for you, princess.

621
00:20:45,681 --> 00:20:48,431
我都不认识你了 快过来 性感帅哥
Who's this guy? Get over here, sexy.

622
00:20:48,431 --> 00:20:50,041
如果你想见识下什么叫性感 我...
If you want to see sexy, I just...

623
00:20:53,181 --> 00:20:54,231
你身上是什么啊
What is all over you?

624
00:20:54,231 --> 00:20:55,821
现在应该是你的鼻涕吧
Well, now you are.
